// GENERATED by docs/tools/gen_arenamaps_menu.py. Do NOT hand-edit (regenerate instead).
// Shared campaign/arena MAP PICKER for Build-A-Base / Cyber Attack / Search & Destroy. Each
// button arms the one-shot engine arena gate sv_mpForceArena and sets ui_dmmap, so the mode's
// map is launched as a script-less MP arena (the mohdm* maps carry bsp spawns; the campaign maps
// use the reused Base Assault/Push spawns in mp_arena_spawns.scr). Reached from the team board's
// 'Campaign Maps' button, which is gated by ui_mpIsArena. Sets only ui_dmmap + sv_mpForceArena.
